    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): carrying and taking in the crate (spec 39 step 6c) (#592)\n\nThe pick-up (carry.rs): which free unit of a formation tending its\ndowned picks up which friend's body, with no foe near it and a load it\ncan still move under, nearest first, each body and bearer once. The\ntakers sent (taking.rs): which free unit of a group out of a fight walks\nout to which downed foe it sees within take reach, nearest first, each\nonce. FormationCarry and FormationTaking are views that hand the crate\nthe squads and land what it decides: the states, the bearers' pace, the\ntakings, the hold and the events. The rule scenarios are cargo tests\nnow. Step 6 is done.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SbQA1BnZdXSYjceCQLTk19\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
